## Stagger Children

Animate list items one by one:

```tsx
const items = ['First', 'Second', 'Third', 'Fourth'];

{items.map((item, i) => (
  <Sequence key={i} from={i * 15} durationInFrames={60}>
    <div>{item}</div>
  </Sequence>
))}
```

